OL,3,GNEWSA'We put Middlesbrough on the map
OL,4,Afor dance music'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe departing owners of one of
OL,7,FMiddlesbrough's most famous nightclubs
OL,8,Fsay they put the town "on the map with
OL,9,Fdance music".
OL,11,FBarry Faulkner Snr and Barry Faulkner
OL,12,FJnr are handing over the keys to The
OL,13,FMiddlesbrough Empire next month after
OL,14,F33 years in charge.
OL,16,FThe Empire has hosted renowned DJs and
OL,17,Facts including Pete Tong, the Arctic
OL,18,FMonkeys and James Arthur, with Faulkner
OL,19,FJnr saying he hoped the new owner would
OL,20,Fbring back some of the "glory days".
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
