OL,3,GNEWSA'We put Middlesbrough on the map
OL,4,Afor dance music'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"At the time, I took a big chance with
OL,7,Fthat place," Faulkner Snr said of
OL,8,Ftaking the former bingo hall and
OL,9,Fturning it into a club, adding: "I
OL,10,Fthink it cleared me out of money when I
OL,11,Ffirst got it."
